    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>If you are moved into a pit or off another elevated surface involuntarily, such as being the target of a <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Thrust\" title=\"Force Thrust\">Force Thrust</a></i> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bantha_Rush\" title=\"Bantha Rush\">Bantha Rush</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to activate the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Levitate\" title=\"Levitate\">Levitate</a></i> Force Power as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>. If you do so, you end your forced movement in the last square before the edge of the precipice. </p>",
